expect: console: burst of 12 lines written
expect: console: input next
send: \x143to b\r                  # Ctrl-T 3: focus b
expect: [console] focus 3 (b)
expect: b: read "to b"
send: \x142hellp\x7fo\x15hi a\r    # Ctrl-T 2, a typo, DEL, Ctrl-U, the line
expect: [console] focus 2 (a)
expect: a: read "hi a"
expect: console: ok   a read exactly "hi a" and b exactly "to b"; nothing else reached a client
expect: console: uart:
expect: , 22 bytes received,
expect: console: ok   receive and THRE interrupts both served, all 22 bytes the harness sent received, no overruns
expect: TEST PASS
expect: DEBUG HALT 0 from TCB
